MODULE: TypeOKExpiryCorruptsLease
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: An expiry callback corrupts the remaining lease.
PERTURBS: Expire
BOUNDS: MayExpire = TRUE
--- FIND
    /\ leaseLeft' = 0
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a lapsed lease leaves the finite domain.
    /\ leaseLeft' = Lease + 1
--- END
